  "claim": "The audit quantifies, separately for each recurrent family, whether ordered recruitment steps improve held-out prediction over an unordered prefix and a matched order shuffle. Evidence is reported as patient-level effect sizes and uncertainty rather than compressed into a global go/no-go gate.",
